378-## Gate-preserving conclusion
379-
380-The source audit establishes implementable channel and host-key paths for both
381:candidates, but neither has an acceptable public client-rekey surface at its
382:pin. SwiftNIO SSH additionally requires forked per-channel window control;
383:libssh2 requires a custom generic direct-tcpip open, a secure method allowlist,
384:and a reproducible extension-safe native package. Scale, rekey, cancellation,
385-memory, binary size, and physical Apple behavior remain experiments for both.
386-
387-ADR-014 therefore remains open. Engine selection belongs to
388-TASK-260715-1gjxer only after the same M0 gates and physical evidence are applied
389-to both candidates.
